	"string" : {
		"readme" : "Aim for ~40 keywords in customkeywords - there is no hard cap, but big sets slow the pick-lists and the on-load keyword restore. 'Load Keywords from File' (Armor MCM page) registers every ID in customkeywords, REPLACING your registered set (asks first). 'Save Keywords to File' writes your set to the top of customkeywords; registering/removing in the MCM never touches this file. copyuprespectlimit holds the rest of the AND set - move IDs up to enable them. Coverage keywords (AND_CoversAll, AND_ArmorTop/Bottom, AND_Bra, AND_Underwear, AND_*Curtain) make AND count an item as covering - e.g. AND_Underwear on panties clears the bottom-exposed state and its modesty covering animation. Male variants live below."
